  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ohS9Jkb7/images/5aa33b607d16d767cd5bb4383839bf4cfef4a549.jpeg\" alt=\"超可愛材質包標頭\"></p>\n<h1>超可愛材質包</h1>\n<hr>\n<a href=\"\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/BrandonItaly/LCE-Resources\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"github-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/github-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/BrandonItaly\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"ghsponsors-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/ghsponsors-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbrandonitaly\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"kofi-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<p>超可愛材質包讓你能打造一個充滿最可愛、最療癒生物的歡樂世界！蹦蹦跳跳的小兔、超萌獨角獸、閃亮的熊蜂，還有……呃，漢堡？沒錯，就是漢堡！連章魚都會讓你忍不住驚呼「 squeee ！」。</p>\n<p>此材質包為方塊、物品、實體與介面增添了超可愛的紋理。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ohS9Jkb7/images/f62fee0ce9deacef7efd0e948ea4387f27fe90c9.png\" alt=\"世界預覽\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ohS9Jkb7/images/db92579b431eb81ea3edcf2855f50515dc041490.png\" alt=\"材質比較\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>本資源包移植自《經典主機版》（Legacy Console Edition）的「超可愛材質包」，並採用《基岩版》的最新紋理進行更新。原始紋理由 4J Studios 製作。</p>",
